{"3601860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tamer Town", "steam_appid": 3601860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Mokiton and manage a unique city as tamers and their monsters unite in battle, evolve, and bond together. <strong>Tamer Town</strong> is a unique blend of monster collecting and city-building gameplay, inviting you to shape an ecosystem where monsters and humans grow, thrive, and stand together in competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/5c1e5e80a528907e381e06710e9d7592.poster.avif?t=1770130158\" width=610 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/5c1e5e80a528907e381e06710e9d7592.webm?t=1770130158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/5c1e5e80a528907e381e06710e9d7592.mp4?t=1770130158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/a86a6f588c2fccb165e708b91416177c.poster.avif?t=1770130158\" width=780 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/a86a6f588c2fccb165e708b91416177c.webm?t=1770130158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise over 130 unique Mokiton</strong>, each with <strong>distinct personalities</strong>, <strong>elemental traits</strong> and <strong>evolution paths</strong>. Support strong bonds between tamers and their Mokiton — it’s the foundation of a thriving city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let Mokiton grow</strong> through shared <strong>training, work and battles</strong> alongside their tamers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Level them up</strong> and unlock <strong>powerful evolutions</strong> through teamwork and care.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/747c65a9c58b1fc7a396e05592affdad.poster.avif?t=1770130158\" width=610 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/747c65a9c58b1fc7a396e05592affdad.webm?t=1770130158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/747c65a9c58b1fc7a396e05592affdad.mp4?t=1770130158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/f01813baaf2a80bcebf786bf6606bb2e.poster.avif?t=1770130158\" width=780 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/f01813baaf2a80bcebf786bf6606bb2e.webm?t=1770130158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your city's reputation determines who wants to live there and strong tamers are essential to your success. Keep Mokiton happy and productive to raise your city's prestige.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a place where tamers and monsters want to live train and grow. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise in the League, go on expeditions and make your city famous across the land.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/e53f0e0ad4a265db786dbd01f744c8cc.poster.avif?t=1770130158\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/e53f0e0ad4a265db786dbd01f744c8cc.webm?t=1770130158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/e53f0e0ad4a265db786dbd01f744c8cc.mp4?t=1770130158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/806b899a8b9bcafa2448de93c2e3d4d1.poster.avif?t=1770130158\" width=780 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/806b899a8b9bcafa2448de93c2e3d4d1.webm?t=1770130158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generate valuable resources, sell goods and invest profits to grow your city. Assign Mokiton to jobs that match their strengths to optimize each building's output. Earn money to unlock new homes, decorations and territories. Shape your city into a thriving hub.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boost your city's performance</strong> by keeping your Mokiton satisfied.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Build elemental decorations</strong> near their homes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft special treats</strong> to meet their needs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/24d236fef999973c743084e254e637ba.poster.avif?t=1770130158\" width=610 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/24d236fef999973c743084e254e637ba.webm?t=1770130158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/24d236fef999973c743084e254e637ba.mp4?t=1770130158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/6303232e0d9f6ac9e3550e5f11f285bf.poster.avif?t=1770130158\" width=780 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/6303232e0d9f6ac9e3550e5f11f285bf.webm?t=1770130158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join high-stakes competitions between cities for the Township Tournament Cup. Build your ultimate team and lead them to victory. Assemble a balanced squad of Mokiton that complement each other.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your battle arena</strong> to suit your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Climb the ranks</strong>, adjust your team to counter rivals, and prove your dominance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control the action by yourself</strong> or let your city's top tamer take the lead in auto-battles. <br> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/6a5cfbbd3a8c2942094fe95a37f061c6.poster.avif?t=1770130158\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/6a5cfbbd3a8c2942094fe95a37f061c6.webm?t=1770130158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/6a5cfbbd3a8c2942094fe95a37f061c6.mp4?t=1770130158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/717303e87d4dfe5f623d8f913f5d9e87.poster.avif?t=1770130158\" width=780 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/717303e87d4dfe5f623d8f913f5d9e87.webm?t=1770130158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay on Your Toes:</strong> Mysterious visitors and dynamic events can appear in your city at any moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face Surprise Challengers:</strong> Respond to unexpected threats to earn unique rewards and rare Mokiton.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test Your Flexibility:</strong> Adapt to unpredictable strategies and unusual team compositions on the fly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seize the Opportunity:</strong> Engage in special encounters that push your tactical skills to the limit.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Mokiton and manage a unique city as tamers and their monsters unite in battle, evolve, and bond together. <strong>Tamer Town</strong> is a unique blend of monster collecting and city-building gameplay, inviting you to shape an ecosystem where monsters and humans grow, thrive, and stand together in competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/5c1e5e80a528907e381e06710e9d7592.poster.avif?t=1770130158\" width=610 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/5c1e5e80a528907e381e06710e9d7592.webm?t=1770130158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/5c1e5e80a528907e381e06710e9d7592.mp4?t=1770130158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/a86a6f588c2fccb165e708b91416177c.poster.avif?t=1770130158\" width=780 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/a86a6f588c2fccb165e708b91416177c.webm?t=1770130158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise over 130 unique Mokiton</strong>, each with <strong>distinct personalities</strong>, <strong>elemental traits</strong> and <strong>evolution paths</strong>. Support strong bonds between tamers and their Mokiton — it’s the foundation of a thriving city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let Mokiton grow</strong> through shared <strong>training, work and battles</strong> alongside their tamers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Level them up</strong> and unlock <strong>powerful evolutions</strong> through teamwork and care.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/747c65a9c58b1fc7a396e05592affdad.poster.avif?t=1770130158\" width=610 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/747c65a9c58b1fc7a396e05592affdad.webm?t=1770130158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/747c65a9c58b1fc7a396e05592affdad.mp4?t=1770130158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/f01813baaf2a80bcebf786bf6606bb2e.poster.avif?t=1770130158\" width=780 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/f01813baaf2a80bcebf786bf6606bb2e.webm?t=1770130158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your city's reputation determines who wants to live there and strong tamers are essential to your success. Keep Mokiton happy and productive to raise your city's prestige.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a pla